---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import MiniGraph from "../components/MiniGraph";
import PreferencePanel from "../components/PreferencePanel";
import SearchExplorer from "../components/SearchExplorer";
import ScienceMedicineEmblem from "../components/ScienceMedicineEmblem.astro";
import { sitePath } from "../lib/site";
import {
  evidenceItems,
  nodes,
  preferenceOptions,
  relations,
} from "../lib/data";
---

<BaseLayout>
  <section class="hero page-shell">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <span class="eyebrow">以人的需要，衡量技术的价值</span>
      <h1>技术的终极目的，就是解决人类疾苦。</h1>
      <p>
        我们探寻先进技术的医疗应用，致力于搭建起科学技术与医学的网络，启发研究方向，赋能未来人类福祉。
      </p>
      <div class="hero-stats" aria-label="首版内容规模">
        <span><strong>{nodes.length}</strong> 个节点</span>
        <span><strong>{relations.length}</strong> 条关系</span>
        <span><strong>{evidenceItems.length}</strong> 张证据卡</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-note">
      <ScienceMedicineEmblem />
      <div class="hero-note-copy">
        <span class="note-index">01</span>
        <p>每一项技术都应该回到一个具体的人类问题：它能<strong>减轻什么、改善什么、还需要证明什么</strong>。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="search-section page-shell" aria-labelledby="search-title">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">从真实问题出发</span>
        <h2 id="search-title">你希望技术帮助解决什么？</h2>
      </div>
      <p>描述一种疾病、一项功能障碍，或一个尚未解决的医学问题。</p>
    </div>
    <SearchExplorer client:load nodes={nodes} />
    <PreferencePanel client:idle options={preferenceOptions} />
  </section>

  <section class="graph-section page-shell" aria-labelledby="graph-title">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">从问题到证据</span>
        <h2 id="graph-title">把技术放回它要解决的医学问题中</h2>
      </div>
      <a class="text-link" href={sitePath("/explore")}>打开完整图谱 →</a>
    </div>
    <MiniGraph client:visible nodes={nodes} relations={relations} />
  </section>

  <section class="principles-section page-shell" aria-labelledby="principles-title">
    <div class="section-heading inverse-heading">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">用人的结局校准技术</span>
        <h2 id="principles-title">真正有价值的技术，要经得起证据检验</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="principle-grid">
      <article><span>01</span><h3>先问解决了什么</h3><p>一项技术必须对应具体疾病负担、功能困难或医疗流程中的真实问题。</p></article>
      <article><span>02</span><h3>再问证据走到哪里</h3><p>获批使用、临床试验、早期人体研究与实验室发现必须清楚分开。</p></article>
      <article><span>03</span><h3>最后问怎样继续验证</h3><p>未来方向将说明研究依据、验证路径，以及距离改善患者结局还有哪些障碍。</p></article>
    </div>
    <a class="button button-light" href={sitePath("/methodology")}>了解我们如何判断技术是否真正有用</a>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
